_GJNCBB":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What are the benefits of 100% Natural Neem Honey?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Neem Honey is known for its anti-inflammatory, antibacterial, and antioxidant properties. It is often used to help with immune support, soothing sore throats, and promoting healthier skin.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_GmU3iF":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":" How is 100% Natural Neem Honey different from other types of honey?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Unlike other honey varieties, Neem Honey has a distinct, slightly bitter flavor. It is darker in color and highly valued in traditional medicine, especially in Ayurvedic practices, for its medicinal and therapeutic qualities.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_C3NXWN":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What is the shelf life of 100% Natural Neem Honey?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Neem Honey has a shelf life of about 12 months when stored properly in a cool, dry place away from sunlight. Ensure the jar is tightly sealed to preserve its natural qualities.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_9eQ6hg":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Can 100% Natural Neem Honey be used in skincare?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Yes, Neem is often used in skincare for its antibacterial properties. It can be applied to acne-prone skin or used as part of face masks to help soothe and moisturize.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_nFptDg":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":" How can Barsana Magic Natural Neem Honey be used?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Our Natural Neem Honey can be used in various ways, including as a natural sweetener in teas, smoothies, and desserts. It can also be applied topically as a natural skincare remedy or added to homemade face masks and hair treatments.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_cNCYkp":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Where can I use 100% Natural Neem Honey?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Neem Honey can be used in various ways, such as in beverages like teas, smoothies, or as a sweetener in baked goods. It is also a popular ingredient in natural health remedies.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_UPqk4C":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Can 100% Natural Neem Honey crystallize?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Yes, like all natural honey, Neem Honey may crystallize over time, particularly when stored at cooler temperatures. This is completely normal, and gently warming the honey will restore its liquid form.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_Y4kNbF":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How is 100% Natural Neem Honey produced?","icon":"dairy","row_content":"<p>100% Natural Neem Honey is produced by bees collecting nectar from neem flowers. This honey is harvested with minimal processing, preserving its natural enzymes, nutrients.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_8ctpJG":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is Natural Neem Honey raw or processed?","icon":"dairy","row_content":"<p>Natural Neem Honey is 100% natural and unprocessed, ensuring that it retains all of its natural enzymes and beneficial properties.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_KBwYVk","collapsible_row_GJNCBB","collapsible_row_GmU3iF","collapsible_row_C3NXWN","collapsible_row_9eQ6hg","collapsible_row_nFptDg","collapsible_row_cNCYkp","collapsible_row_UPqk4C","collapsible_row_Y4kNbF","collapsible_row_8ctpJG"],"custom_css":[".collapsible-content-wrapper-narrow {max-width: 80%;}"],"settings":{"caption":"","heading":"Q & A Section","heading_size":"h2","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"none","color_scheme":"","container_color_scheme":"","open_first_collapsible_row":true,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"custom_liquid_LtUNqz":{"type":"custom-liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<!-- Start of Judge.me code -->\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<